---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Premium Enrichment Programs | Marietta Childcare"
  description="Discover Marietta Childcare's premium enrichment programs including STEM, music, arts, sports, and advanced academics.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/art_supplies_flat_lay_colors_background.jpg" 
        alt="Enrichment programs" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">Premium Enrichment Programs</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">STEM learning, music, arts, sports, and advanced academics for enriched childcare experiences.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Premium Enrichment Programs at Marietta Childcare</h1>
        
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">Marietta Childcare offers premium enrichment programs for families seeking advanced learning opportunities. Marietta Childcare's enrichment programs support children's diverse interests and talents.</p>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">STEM Learning Programs</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides STEM learning programs for interested children. STEM programming at Marietta Childcare includes science, technology, engineering, and mathematics. Marietta Childcare's STEM approach develops critical thinking and problem-solving skills.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's STEM activities include hands-on experiments and exploration. STEM learning at Marietta Childcare prepares children for advanced academics. Marietta Childcare's enrichment programs support children's intellectual development.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Music and Arts Programs</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers music and arts enrichment programs. Music programming at Marietta Childcare includes singing, instruments, and rhythm activities. Marietta Childcare's arts programs include painting, drawing, sculpture, and creative expression.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's music and arts programs develop creativity and self-expression. Enrichment at Marietta Childcare includes exposure to diverse artistic traditions. Marietta Childcare's programs support children's artistic development.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Sports and Physical Activities</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides sports and physical activity enrichment. Sports programming at Marietta Childcare includes soccer, basketball, gymnastics, and dance. Marietta Childcare's physical programs develop motor skills and athletic abilities.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's sports programs promote fitness and healthy habits. Physical activities at Marietta Childcare include team sports and individual pursuits. Marietta Childcare's enrichment supports children's physical development.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Advanced Academic Programs</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers advanced academic enrichment programs. Advanced academics at Marietta Childcare include accelerated learning and advanced curriculum. Marietta Childcare's programs support gifted and talented learners.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's advanced programs challenge high-achieving children. Academic enrichment at Marietta Childcare includes enriched curriculum and specialized instruction. Marietta Childcare's programs support children's academic advancement.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Language and Literacy Programs</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides language and literacy enrichment programs. Language programming at Marietta Childcare includes foreign language instruction. Marietta Childcare's literacy programs include advanced reading and writing.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's language programs develop communication skills. Literacy enrichment at Marietta Childcare supports early reading and writing development. Marietta Childcare's programs enhance children's language abilities.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Specialized Instruction and Expertise</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare employs specialized instructors for enrichment programs. Specialized instruction at Marietta Childcare includes trained professionals in various areas. Marietta Childcare's instructors bring expertise and passion to enrichment programs.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's specialized staff provides quality instruction. Expertise at Marietta Childcare ensures high-quality enrichment experiences. Marietta Childcare's commitment to quality extends to enrichment programming.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Flexible Enrichment Options</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers flexible enrichment program options. Enrichment programs at Marietta Childcare can be added to regular childcare. Marietta Childcare's flexibility allows families to choose programs matching their interests.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's enrichment options accommodate various family preferences. Programs at Marietta Childcare can be customized to individual children's interests. Marietta Childcare's flexibility supports diverse learning interests.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Enrichment Pricing and Value</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers premium enrichment programs at competitive prices. Enrichment pricing at Marietta Childcare reflects specialized instruction and materials. Marietta Childcare's programs provide excellent value for families.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's enrichment programs support children's development and interests. Value at Marietta Childcare includes expert instruction and quality materials. Marietta Childcare's commitment to enrichment supports children's growth.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Talent Development and Exploration</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's enrichment programs support talent development and exploration. Talent development at Marietta Childcare includes identifying and nurturing children's strengths. Marietta Childcare's programs help children explore diverse interests.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's enrichment approach supports children's passion discovery. Exploration at Marietta Childcare includes exposure to various activities and disciplines. Marietta Childcare's programs help children develop their talents and interests.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Explore Premium Enrichment</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Marietta Childcare offers premium enrichment programs to support your child's interests and talents. Contact Marietta Childcare to learn about available enrichment options.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Contact Us</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Pages</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/faq/curriculum" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">What's Your Curriculum?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/programs" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Our Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/faq/teacher-qualifications" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">What Are Your Teacher Qualifications?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">About Marietta Childcare</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Contact Marietta Childcare</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
